<title>JORDAN: Jordan overnight rates 6.991 pct - Central Bank.</title>
<headline>Jordan overnight rates 6.991 pct - Central Bank.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight rate on the Jordanian dinar stood at 6.991 percent on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The rate was unchanged from Sunday's rate, which traders put at between 6.75 percent and 7.00 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
